# Pre-baked session canon (ticket 86c9kwhbc — D)
# Canon JSONs are committed so Vercel builds don't re-bake on every deploy
# (the script's skip-if-exists logic short-circuits before any API call).
# Re-generate locally with `npm run canon:regen` only when prompts or
# curriculum change, then commit the diff alongside the change.

# Picture-pack reference assets (Phase 2 Midjourney PNGs)
# These are trace-references only — Phase 3 SVGs go in
# `public/assets/pictures/` instead. The PNGs are large (~3.9 MB combined)
# and have no runtime use; keep them out of the bundle.
design/references/picture-pack/*.png
